        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ab22f88d-f567-43a2-b20f-0ecc17257ffe).Image",
        "Description": "ICA intelligence has intercepted a plan to deploy Helmut Kruger in covert operations. \r\rDue to his complete lack of tactical ability—and his uncanny resemblance to Agent 47—Kruger poses a significant risk to operational integrity. \r\rIf IAGO succeeds in activating him, his incompetence could compromise future missions and expose our top operative. \r\rEliminate Kruger swiftly and silently to ensure this plan never materializes.",
